{"id":"resp_b01312fc48c31014","created_at":1795549432,"incomplete_details":null,"instructions":null,"metadata":null,"model":"gpt-oss-120b","object":"response","output":[{"id":"rs_b1e73f4e4c870b71","summary":[],"type":"reasoning","content":[{"text":"We need to produce SHACL constraints representing the requirement: boundary between bottom and lower regions is taken at point where shell is inclined 7° from horizontal.\n\nWe have ontology terms:\n- hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint: object property from ship to hullBoundaryPoint.\n- hullBoundaryPoint: class subclass of benchmarkEntity.\n- shellInclinationAngle: quantity property (ObjectProperty) with domain benchmarkEntity, range QuantityValue.\n- shellInclinationAngle has unit DEG (DEG unit IRI).\n\nWe also have quantityEncoding: numeric_predicate = http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/numericValue, unit_predicate = http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/unit.\n\nThus a hullBoundaryPoint instance should have a shellInclinationAngle property pointing to a QuantityValue with numericValue = 7 and unit = http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG.\n\nWe need SHACL shape that enforces:\n\n- For each ship (target class ship), there must be a hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint link to some hullBoundaryPoint.\n\n- For each such hullBoundaryPoint, there must be a shellInclinationAngle with a QuantityValue whose numericValue = 7 (maybe exact) and unit = DEG.\n\nWe must not assume any extra owners; use termOwners mapping: hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint belongs to ship (owner), shellInclinationAngle belongs to hullBoundaryPoint.\n\nThe contract says target_owner is null, meaning no explicit global target? But admission focus_set says owner_class = ship. So we should target ship class.\n\nThus shape targeting all individuals of type ship.\n\nWe will create shapes:\n\n- ex:ShipShape a sh:NodeShape; sh:targetClass nltl:ship; sh:property ... for hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint.\n\nThe property: path nltl:hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint; sh:minCount 1; sh:node ex:HullBoundaryPointShape.\n\nHullBoundaryPointShape: targetClass nltl:hullBoundaryPoint; then property shellInclinationAngle.\n\nWe need to enforce that the QuantityValue node (shell inclination angle) has numericValue 7 and unit DEGREES.\n\nWe can define a shape for QuantityValue: ex:AngleValueShape with property numericValue equal 7 (sh:hasValue \"7\"^^xsd:decimal) and unit equals DEG (sh:hasValue <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG>).\n\nBut we need to refer to quantityEncoding predicates: numeric_predicate and unit_predicate. However those are just the IRIs; we can use them directly.\n\nThus in shape for shellInclinationAngle: sh:node ex:AngleValueShape.\n\nAngleValueShape: property path qudt:numericValue; sh:hasValue \"7\"^^xsd:decimal; sh:datatype xsd:decimal? also maybe sh:minInclusive / maxInclusive? But per requirement exactly 7 deg.\n\nunit: path qudt:unit; sh:hasValue <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/DEG>.\n\nWe also include sh:datatype xsd:decimal for numeric.\n\nAlso include rdfs:label etc maybe not needed.\n\nWe need to include imports: prefixes.\n\nDefine prefixes: sh, rdf, rdfs, xsd, nltl (https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#), qudt (http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/), unit (http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/). Use those.\n\nNow need to adhere to instruction: Do not invent missing owners, applicability, etc. We are not adding extra constraints beyond requirement.\n\nAlso note: target class of second shape is hullBoundaryPoint, but we may not need targetClass if only used via node constraint; but better to define shape with sh:targetClass nltl:hullBoundaryPoint.\n\nSimilarly angle value shape may target QuantityValue class: sh:targetClass qudt:QuantityValue.\n\nNow produce final Turtle with <BEGIN_SHACL> and <END_SHACL>.\n\nInclude comments explaining ambiguous items? Not necessary.\n\nLet's construct.\n\n","type":"reasoning_text"}],"encrypted_content":null,"status":null},{"id":"msg_8c3dc33260b59996","content":[{"annotations":[],"text":"<BEGIN_SHACL>\n@prefix sh: <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#> .\n@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .\n@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .\n@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .\n@prefix nltl: <https://w3id.org/nltl/vocab#> .\n@prefix qudt: <http://qudt.org/schema/qudt/> .\n@prefix unit: <http://qudt.org/vocab/unit/> .\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------\n# Shape for each ship: must reference a hull‑boundary point that\n# defines the bottom/lower‑region boundary.\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------\nex:ShipShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass nltl:ship ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:hasBottomRegionLowerRegionBoundaryPoint ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:node ex:HullBoundaryPointShape ;\n    ] .\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------\n# Shape for the hull‑boundary point that is linked from a ship.\n# It must carry a shell‑inclination‑angle quantity.\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------\nex:HullBoundaryPointShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass nltl:hullBoundaryPoint ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path nltl:shellInclinationAngle ;\n        sh:minCount 1 ;\n        sh:node ex:ShellInclinationAngleValueShape ;\n    ] .\n\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------\n# Shape for the QuantityValue representing the shell inclination.\n# The value must be exactly 7 degrees.\n# -----------------------------------------------------------------\nex:ShellInclinationAngleValueShape\n    a sh:NodeShape ;\n    sh:targetClass qudt:QuantityValue ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path qudt:numericValue ;\n        sh:hasValue \"7\"^^xsd:decimal ;\n        sh:datatype xsd:decimal ;\n    ] ;\n    sh:property [\n        sh:path qudt:unit ;\n        sh:hasValue unit:DEG ;\n    ] .\n<END_SHACL>","type":"output_text","logprobs":null}],"role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message","phase":null}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"temperature":1.0,"tool_choice":"none","tools":[],"top_p":1.0,"background":false,"max_output_tokens":16000,"max_tool_calls":null,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt":null,"prompt_cache_options":null,"prompt_cache_key":null,"prompt_cache_retention":null,"reasoning":null,"safety_identifier":null,"service_tier":"auto","status":"completed","text":null,"top_logprobs":null,"truncation":"disabled","usage":{"input_tokens":12979,"input_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":64,"cache_write_tokens":12912,"input_tokens_per_turn":[12979],"cached_tokens_per_turn":[64]},"output_tokens":1310,"output_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":836,"tool_output_tokens":0,"output_tokens_per_turn":[1310],"tool_output_tokens_per_turn":[0]},"total_tokens":14289},"user":null,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"kv_transfer_params":null,"ec_transfer_params":null,"input_messages":null,"output_messages":null}